<description>&lt;p&gt;The government has expanded its BIR rapid-intervention force around Lake Chad and is deploying drones and joint border patrols to target Anglophone separatists in the Northwest and Southwest, where attacks on troops continue. Government troops killed four suspected separatists after a deadly village attack and suspended Issa Tchiroma’s political party for three months. An army vehicle hit a landmine near the Cameroon border, killing eight soldiers, and attacks on police and government sites in Fundong injured three people. 231 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPOUJwSWV2VmV4Vkl1QXhGa19IdkREcVB5czJYbmVzOUF2WDRYcWcyWGVuVG9ubmUwWE0ydk9HeDR0UlVoS2hJUkJ5VWJwS1ZJbEo2X1loOFNpSDI4R0x4S0wzUWV2MGpqV1VuSXBWLXlkVDZVV2lsVEhjTEVDZXg2M0dQc3dqU3UzMVUzY1hQTWtlRVFjcGxDREhYZGVWNHlUOHFOYzBwaFVKUVJZZjByMWw5eWM5YjhUeWtRLWMzZlB3dEFK?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOeXprSkVGSVd2UHlmZW04RUZlSzBCQ0s5cURWelduU0ZpRlRpZm1PT3VmZDZ1SDdhWTcwYWd5Q09KS20zWW9tMDlxQUhxSkNXNlM4WmFzYkU2SnV6U0RkZkIyV2dUc3ozWnlRMG5RU2Q0OGR0N092MTVOSHRwUk56bTVfWGFKTGZGbFBOLXVVa3htRmVNeXNOVW04by16OTN6YnBjV1ZlWHR1SWhzOVMxb3JLTG9TMy01MkxycWpyY2Etbk9IZEJUaGg4RE4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;wthr.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNVHpPak5xeV90MVY4c0EtZ1dCQ0RqTndQYWZkajIwZ3k2R3ZFVUtiUU1FMjA0d2NHeWE2Znp1Z1BfczhTb3IzeHBGNGRZWkU4clFaU3hWd25XQUQ5bzRxc2NqemppQmhrZ0NoTHprSVhZX2wzSS1PQzZ4SDU2SGN4VkhWUm9IZzZKQWVNY3lzRHBKaFBmeElLc25SVjgzRlhYMzluWmRE